WEBVTT

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:15.750
Full energy is troubled because there's no place to go

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:22.030
A slight shake destroys boredom

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:28.170
I Ride, On the White Line  OH, OH, OH

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:34.240
Sit Down  At the place I trust  OH, OH, OH

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:37.540
We can go even if we're lost

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:43.650
Everyone receives freedom and passion

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:49.850
We were born to shine, and our journey continues

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:56.060
Your soul is the key that supports our uncertain days

00:00:56.350 --> 00:01:02.000
The best growth creates an unstoppable WILD DRIVE

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:08.270
We still quietly knock on the door

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:22.000
Bakura, this will destroy your occult combo!

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:24.800
The spell card Monster Reborn!

00:01:29.100 --> 00:01:31.100
I resurrect Dark Necrofear!

00:01:39.770 --> 00:01:44.520
Since Dark Necrofear has resurrected, Dark Sanctuary's effect is gone.

00:01:44.520 --> 00:01:45.520
Damn!

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:50.020
D-E-A-T.  You have four letters.

00:01:50.600 --> 00:01:54.390
But you'll never get the last letter!

00:01:54.750 --> 00:01:56.290
I draw a card!

00:01:59.450 --> 00:02:01.220
You're done, Yugi!

00:02:01.220 --> 00:02:05.540
With this card, you can't break my occult combo!

00:02:05.540 --> 00:02:06.420
What?

00:02:09.540 --> 00:02:15.550
Destroy the Darkness  God's Strike!

00:02:26.120 --> 00:02:28.340
Too bad, Yugi.

00:02:28.340 --> 00:02:34.230
I praise you for almost finishing me, but you've reached your end.

00:02:35.880 --> 00:02:37.230
Get ready.

00:02:37.650 --> 00:02:40.470
I summon Jowgen the Spiritualist!

00:02:44.650 --> 00:02:46.780
Jowgen the Spiritualist?

00:02:46.780 --> 00:02:49.000
Jowgen?  Who's that?

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:51.170
What?  You don't know?

00:02:51.280 --> 00:02:52.780
Do you?

00:02:52.920 --> 00:02:55.790
Of course not!  I'm not a duelist!

00:02:57.710 --> 00:03:04.800
By discarding one card from my hand, its special ability destroys all Special Summoned monsters.

00:03:05.050 --> 00:03:06.140
That means...

00:03:06.140 --> 00:03:11.120
Yugi used Monster Reborn to Special Summon Dark Necrofear, so it'll be destroyed.

00:03:11.120 --> 00:03:15.250
If Dark Necrofear is destroyed, Dark Sanctuary will work again!

00:03:17.220 --> 00:03:18.980
I send this to the graveyard.

00:03:20.770 --> 00:03:27.650
Jowgen the Spiritualist, destroy Dark Necrofear because it was Special Summoned!

00:03:32.800 --> 00:03:36.960
Dark Necrofear returns to Bakura's graveyard.

00:03:49.440 --> 00:03:51.600
That's right, Yugi.

00:03:51.880 --> 00:03:58.820
Since Dark Necrofear is back in the graveyard,  Dark Sanctuary's effect works again.

00:03:59.200 --> 00:04:04.320
I can place ten trap and spell cards again.

00:04:08.970 --> 00:04:11.700
The field is creepy again!

00:04:11.920 --> 00:04:14.700
Now's not the time to be scared!

00:04:14.700 --> 00:04:17.900
Yugi is going to lose next turn!

00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:19.040
Yugi!

00:04:19.200 --> 00:04:20.300
Yugi...

00:04:20.520 --> 00:04:23.710
I still believe in Yugi!

00:04:23.710 --> 00:04:24.580
Brother.

00:04:25.020 --> 00:04:28.880
One turn is enough for Yugi to win!

00:04:28.880 --> 00:04:31.320
He's done it before!

00:04:35.200 --> 00:04:39.090
There's no way to break my occult combo.

00:04:39.800 --> 00:04:42.510
The five letters will spell DEATH next turn.

00:04:43.480 --> 00:04:46.100
It's a death sentence for you!

00:04:47.680 --> 00:04:52.010
I tribute Jowgen to keep Dark Sanctuary!

00:04:53.210 --> 00:04:55.580
I set one card!

00:04:55.580 --> 00:04:57.150
I end my turn!

00:05:03.790 --> 00:05:05.420
Let me tell you, Yugi.

00:05:05.720 --> 00:05:13.920
You can't see it, but Dark Sanctuary's ghost is wandering your field again.

00:05:13.940 --> 00:05:15.080
What?

00:05:15.080 --> 00:05:17.330
It's my final turn.

00:05:17.600 --> 00:05:21.570
Due to The Dark Door's effect, only one monster can attack.

00:05:22.170 --> 00:05:26.570
But the ghost will possess one of my three monsters.

00:05:27.600 --> 00:05:29.240
That's not all.

00:05:29.770 --> 00:05:34.250
My set card is Dark Spirit of the Silent.

00:05:34.250 --> 00:05:36.290
Dark Spirit of the Silent?

00:05:36.290 --> 00:05:37.250
That's right.

00:05:37.430 --> 00:05:40.250
No matter what monster you choose...

00:05:40.250 --> 00:05:46.600
...Dark Spirit of the Silent will force your possessed monster to attack.

00:05:47.620 --> 00:05:50.170
This is my final turn.

00:05:50.170 --> 00:05:55.270
If Destiny Board gets its fifth letter during the End Phase, I lose.

00:05:55.870 --> 00:05:59.100
But I can't make a comeback with these cards.

00:06:00.370 --> 00:06:02.460
You finally understand, Yugi.

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:05.580
You have zero chance of winning!

00:06:05.830 --> 00:06:08.860
Unless something changes, Yugi can't win!

00:06:08.860 --> 00:06:10.940
Otogi!  You're still saying that?

00:06:10.940 --> 00:06:15.400
Honda, I understand how you feel, but he's right.

00:06:15.670 --> 00:06:17.700
Bakura's combo is perfect.

00:06:17.700 --> 00:06:20.320
Even Yugi can't win this time.

00:06:20.620 --> 00:06:22.590
Is that true, brother?

00:06:22.770 --> 00:06:24.660
I believe in Yugi.

00:06:24.980 --> 00:06:26.140
Jonouchi?

00:06:26.140 --> 00:06:28.170
I'll always believe in him!

00:06:28.170 --> 00:06:33.170
A true duelist never gives up hope!

00:06:34.600 --> 00:06:36.000
You're right.

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:39.180
Yugi isn't the type who'll lose here.

00:06:39.480 --> 00:06:41.180
Yugi!  Hang in there!

00:06:41.510 --> 00:06:43.680
Don't lose, Yugi!

00:06:43.970 --> 00:06:46.020
Yugi!

00:06:46.820 --> 00:06:48.020
Hear that?

00:06:48.200 --> 00:06:49.650
It's pointless.

00:06:49.650 --> 00:06:54.860
No matter how loud they cheer, Yugi can't defeat me.

00:06:55.060 --> 00:07:01.070
No, I have one card that makes the impossible possible.

00:07:01.670 --> 00:07:04.370
Everything depends on this draw.

00:07:04.600 --> 00:07:07.370
Good luck, my other self!

00:07:07.370 --> 00:07:08.210
Partner...

00:07:08.520 --> 00:07:12.770
In order to retrieve your memories, you can't lose.

00:07:12.770 --> 00:07:14.950
You must win.

00:07:15.250 --> 00:07:16.950
You must draw that card.

00:07:17.100 --> 00:07:18.680
You're right.

00:07:19.080 --> 00:07:22.520
The card you placed in our deck.

00:07:24.510 --> 00:07:26.260
Summon the God, Yugi!

00:07:27.730 --> 00:07:31.160
As a duelist, I give my all on this draw!

00:07:31.350 --> 00:07:32.400
I draw a card!

00:07:43.820 --> 00:07:51.860
I tribute Dark Magician Girl, Gamma The Magnet Warrior and Big Shield Gardna!

00:07:52.150 --> 00:07:55.020
Descend, Slifer!

00:08:20.080 --> 00:08:21.780
Slifer?

00:08:21.780 --> 00:08:26.310
Destiny Board's death combo will be completed this turn.

00:08:26.310 --> 00:08:31.290
But he was able to use his single chance to summon the legendary dragon?

00:08:31.860 --> 00:08:33.110
What?

00:08:33.110 --> 00:08:34.290
Wow!

00:08:34.470 --> 00:08:36.360
That's Slifer?

00:08:36.360 --> 00:08:38.860
Yugi's God Card!

00:08:39.220 --> 00:08:42.180
He drew a God Card on his last turn.

00:08:42.800 --> 00:08:47.370
Yugi, that's why I believe you're a great duelist.

00:08:56.230 --> 00:09:00.550
A God Card is the Pharaoh's faithful servant.

00:09:00.860 --> 00:09:08.300
Whoever gathers the three God Cards during Battle City will gain the title of the Pharaoh.

00:09:08.640 --> 00:09:14.740
When the Pharaoh overcomes this test, he'll regain his lost memories.

00:09:17.600 --> 00:09:20.150
My memories are sealed away in darkness.

00:09:20.150 --> 00:09:24.860
I fight for the single ray of light that will bring back my memories!

00:09:24.860 --> 00:09:26.580
Get ready, Bakura!

00:09:27.820 --> 00:09:33.250
By summoning Slifer, he turned this duel around.

00:09:33.250 --> 00:09:34.080
Marik!

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:38.650
Slifer's attack points are determined by the number of cards in his hand.

00:09:38.930 --> 00:09:41.660
Yugi has three cards in his hand.

00:09:42.400 --> 00:09:46.190
Therefore, Slifer has 3000 attack points.

00:09:46.660 --> 00:09:48.730
3000 attack points!

00:09:48.930 --> 00:09:51.930
You only have 1200 life points.

00:09:52.250 --> 00:09:56.140
When Slifer attacks you, you're finished.

00:09:56.140 --> 00:09:57.110
Not yet!

00:09:57.500 --> 00:10:01.700
Dark Sanctuary's ghost still wanders the field!

00:10:02.330 --> 00:10:05.310
Go, Dark Sanctuary's ghost!

00:10:05.800 --> 00:10:07.280
Possess the God!

00:10:10.840 --> 00:10:13.390
What?  The ghost vanished?

00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:19.130
No good.  A ghost can't possess a God.

00:10:19.500 --> 00:10:22.130
The ghost is worthless?

00:10:22.420 --> 00:10:26.170
Even if I want to do something else, I have no cards in my hand.

00:10:26.480 --> 00:10:29.620
And I have no monsters to protect me.

00:10:29.620 --> 00:10:33.680
I only have the set card Dark Spirit of the Silent.

00:10:34.140 --> 00:10:36.960
But Slifer is his only monster.

00:10:37.280 --> 00:10:42.450
This trap is useless if he doesn't have another monster to attack with.

00:10:42.680 --> 00:10:45.520
I'm out of options.

00:10:47.450 --> 00:10:50.290
I win this duel, Bakura!

00:10:51.630 --> 00:10:54.040
Yeah!  Go, Yugi!

00:10:54.040 --> 00:10:57.710
Attack with your God to turn Bakura back to normal!

00:10:57.710 --> 00:10:58.940
Here I go, Bakura!

00:10:59.240 --> 00:11:00.440
It's over.

00:11:00.680 --> 00:11:03.940
But I have a contingency plan.

00:11:03.940 --> 00:11:04.870
What?

00:11:04.990 --> 00:11:07.180
Slifer the Sky Dragon attacks!

00:11:08.480 --> 00:11:09.680
Thunder-

00:11:17.020 --> 00:11:17.950
He's...

00:11:51.720 --> 00:11:54.720
Marik!  What are you doing here?

00:11:54.720 --> 00:11:55.560
Jonouchi!

00:11:55.560 --> 00:11:56.700
Calm down!

00:11:56.700 --> 00:11:57.880
Let me go!

00:12:00.700 --> 00:12:05.420
I won't let you interfere in someone else's duel!

00:12:05.750 --> 00:12:07.000
Marik...

00:12:07.200 --> 00:12:08.170
You!

00:12:08.420 --> 00:12:10.170
Listen, Yugi.

00:12:10.420 --> 00:12:16.220
Due to my Millennium Rod, that boy is my puppet.

00:12:16.220 --> 00:12:18.220
What do you mean?

00:12:18.220 --> 00:12:21.750
A dark being already controls Bakura.

00:12:21.750 --> 00:12:26.500
Yes.  Two different minds control him.

00:12:26.500 --> 00:12:28.420
I'll prove it to you.

00:12:28.420 --> 00:12:31.930
I'll free his mind.

00:12:31.930 --> 00:12:32.430
What?

00:12:33.000 --> 00:12:35.630
What are you planning?

00:12:35.630 --> 00:12:40.430
If you want to defeat Yugi, then let me handle this and free the host.

00:12:40.640 --> 00:12:41.650
What?

00:12:41.650 --> 00:12:44.760
Do it now.  Don't you want to win?

00:12:49.840 --> 00:12:52.510
It hurts...

00:12:52.770 --> 00:12:53.610
Bakura!

00:12:53.900 --> 00:12:55.850
Bakura!

00:12:56.420 --> 00:12:59.590
Yugi, where am I?

00:12:59.940 --> 00:13:02.000
What am I doing here?

00:13:02.700 --> 00:13:04.590
Why am I hurt?

00:13:04.960 --> 00:13:05.880
Bakura...

00:13:06.280 --> 00:13:10.240
As you can see, he's badly injured.

00:13:10.500 --> 00:13:18.670
Yugi, an attack from a God will deal such traumatic damage that it may end his life.

00:13:18.860 --> 00:13:19.710
What?

00:13:20.000 --> 00:13:22.010
Are you still willing to attack?

00:13:22.350 --> 00:13:25.750
You're using Bakura's life as a shield, Marik?

00:13:26.140 --> 00:13:27.480
That's cheating, Marik!

00:13:27.990 --> 00:13:29.700
Bakura!  Pull yourself together!

00:13:29.700 --> 00:13:30.490
Yugi!

00:13:31.760 --> 00:13:33.220
Good, Rishido.

00:13:35.800 --> 00:13:41.850
Master Marik, the strong winds tearing at my skin isn't the reason why I feel pain in my heart.

00:13:43.400 --> 00:13:45.270
It hurts, Yugi.

00:13:45.500 --> 00:13:46.500
Bakura!

00:13:46.720 --> 00:13:48.370
Stop, Yugi Muto!

00:13:48.370 --> 00:13:51.740
You're not allowed to touch your opponent during a duel.

00:13:51.740 --> 00:13:54.240
You will lose by resignation.

00:13:55.400 --> 00:13:58.540
If I attack Bakura, the duel will end.

00:13:58.540 --> 00:14:00.250
But Bakura will be...

00:14:00.400 --> 00:14:02.600
Stop the duel!

00:14:02.600 --> 00:14:06.320
If Bakura doesn't get medical attention, he may die!

00:14:06.770 --> 00:14:10.740
Yugi, if you don't attack this turn...

00:14:10.740 --> 00:14:14.830
...Destiny Board will get its fifth letter, and you will lose.

00:14:15.100 --> 00:14:18.060
Continue the duel, Yugi Muto!

00:14:20.260 --> 00:14:21.470
Yugi...

00:14:21.900 --> 00:14:26.970
Bakura doesn't have the strength to survive a God's attack.

00:14:26.970 --> 00:14:29.980
What's wrong?  Why do you hesitate?

00:14:29.980 --> 00:14:31.710
Finish him, Yugi!

00:14:31.900 --> 00:14:37.830
If you don't continue, I'll judge that you're unwilling to duel and-

00:14:37.830 --> 00:14:38.860
Hey mister!

00:14:38.860 --> 00:14:41.330
Stop blabbing and end the duel!

00:14:41.330 --> 00:14:43.460
-We already know who'll win! 
-Jonouchi!

00:14:43.860 --> 00:14:46.960
Calm down or I'll disqualify you!

00:14:46.960 --> 00:14:49.960
What?  Disqualified?

00:14:49.960 --> 00:14:51.570
Fine!

00:14:51.570 --> 00:14:55.970
Go ahead and try!  I'll pummel you instead!

00:14:57.350 --> 00:14:59.340
Continue the duel!

00:14:59.530 --> 00:15:00.840
Do it, Yugi!

00:15:05.680 --> 00:15:07.360
My other self...

00:15:08.180 --> 00:15:12.350
Marik, this is a smart way to corner Yugi.

00:15:13.800 --> 00:15:16.090
I did this because we have an agreement.

00:15:19.370 --> 00:15:21.100
Impressive, Marik.

00:15:21.400 --> 00:15:25.830
You're much nastier than my occult deck.

00:15:27.330 --> 00:15:32.770
But when it comes to ways of winning, I have my own preferences!

00:15:32.970 --> 00:15:34.750
Stay back, Marik!

00:15:41.370 --> 00:15:45.020
The dark being is controlling Bakura again!

00:15:46.160 --> 00:15:50.000
Yugi, I'll let you win this time.

00:15:50.000 --> 00:15:51.520
Attack me.

00:15:51.520 --> 00:15:52.190
What?

00:15:52.460 --> 00:15:56.930
Don't worry.  I won't let your friend Bakura die.

00:15:58.240 --> 00:16:02.200
This host body is most important to me.

00:16:02.200 --> 00:16:04.500
I can't let it die.

00:16:04.840 --> 00:16:06.510
Bring it, Yugi!

00:16:06.620 --> 00:16:07.510
Here I go!

00:16:07.510 --> 00:16:11.010
Slifer the Sky Dragon, attack him directly!

00:16:13.280 --> 00:16:17.420
Yugi, I'll bury you in eternal darkness eventually.

00:16:21.110 --> 00:16:25.420
In the end, I'll be the one who has the powers of darkness!

00:16:35.960 --> 00:16:37.880
Yugi Muto is the winner!

00:16:37.880 --> 00:16:39.940
He passes the first round!

00:16:40.580 --> 00:16:41.340
Bakura!

00:16:41.340 --> 00:16:44.680
Stop wasting time!  Lower the Duel Ring!

00:16:47.950 --> 00:16:49.300
Hang in there, Bakura!

00:16:49.950 --> 00:16:50.920
Bakura!

00:16:53.650 --> 00:16:54.590
Yugi...

00:16:54.850 --> 00:16:56.870
Good.  He's still conscious.

00:16:56.870 --> 00:16:58.650
His arm is bleeding badly!

00:16:58.650 --> 00:17:00.480
He needs treatment now!

00:17:00.480 --> 00:17:02.800
Let's take him to his room.

00:17:04.460 --> 00:17:07.210
Bakura, get on my back.

00:17:07.890 --> 00:17:09.710
Hang in there, Bakura.

00:17:14.500 --> 00:17:16.340
Comfortable, Bakura?

00:17:16.620 --> 00:17:24.580
The evil being in the Millennium Ring sacrificed himself to save his host.

00:17:25.280 --> 00:17:29.240
That is the destiny of the souls inside the Millennium Items.

00:17:30.500 --> 00:17:40.020
Even though he's evil, he has to protect his other self.  Just like me.

00:17:40.800 --> 00:17:44.540
I think you're slightly wrong, my other self.

00:17:44.540 --> 00:17:45.440
Partner.

00:17:45.600 --> 00:17:48.080
I know that you're protecting me.

00:17:48.080 --> 00:17:55.530
I also know that the darkness in the Millennium Ring and Bakura share the same body, just like us.

00:17:55.530 --> 00:17:59.090
However, I want to help you.

00:18:00.170 --> 00:18:06.730
Ever since I assembled the Millennium Puzzle and met you, I wanted to become stronger.

00:18:06.730 --> 00:18:10.530
For myself and for you.

00:18:10.680 --> 00:18:11.660
Partner...

00:18:11.660 --> 00:18:16.570
But currently, I can only change places with you.

00:18:17.170 --> 00:18:20.380
You must be tired from your duel against Bakura.

00:18:20.380 --> 00:18:22.140
So take a rest.

00:18:22.270 --> 00:18:25.210
I'll do that, partner.

00:18:25.420 --> 00:18:26.350
Touch!

00:18:30.930 --> 00:18:31.930
Wait!

00:18:31.930 --> 00:18:32.320
What?

00:18:32.680 --> 00:18:41.060
As the winner, the ante rule allows you to take a card from Ryo Bakura's deck.

00:18:41.320 --> 00:18:42.500
I don't want to!

00:18:42.500 --> 00:18:44.900
Bakura's hurt!  This isn't the time!

00:18:46.630 --> 00:18:50.980
As expected, Yugi won the first match.

00:18:51.840 --> 00:18:53.000
Of course.

00:18:53.000 --> 00:18:58.380
Only a duelist chosen by a God can defeat him.

00:18:58.840 --> 00:19:00.640
Yugi, just wait.

00:19:00.640 --> 00:19:03.760
I'll defeat you in the final match.

00:19:06.760 --> 00:19:12.640
We stopped the bleeding for now, but we should take him to a hospital.

00:19:12.640 --> 00:19:13.560
Yeah.

00:19:13.560 --> 00:19:18.060
Yugi won his first match, but I don't feel relieved.

00:19:21.880 --> 00:19:26.640
My other self could've lost this time.

00:19:27.420 --> 00:19:35.880
When Bakura was near death in the last turn, my other self couldn't attack him.

00:19:36.200 --> 00:19:41.390
If Bakura's personality didn't change, he wouldn't attack and lost.

00:19:41.730 --> 00:19:46.160
The being inside the Millennium Ring let you win?

00:19:46.160 --> 00:19:49.260
He thought my other self would attack him.

00:19:49.260 --> 00:19:53.060
That's why he changed places to protect his host.

00:19:53.060 --> 00:19:58.140
Then he shouldn't have let his host appear in the first place.

00:19:58.450 --> 00:20:04.380
It was another presence that brought out the host.  It was Marik.

00:20:04.380 --> 00:20:10.040
Marik used his Millennium Item again to control his mind?

00:20:10.240 --> 00:20:16.120
Yes.  Marik planned to win by using Bakura's life as a shield.

00:20:16.120 --> 00:20:20.360
But the dark being inside Bakura stopped him.

00:20:20.660 --> 00:20:25.430
It was Marik who figured out my other self's intentions.

00:20:25.800 --> 00:20:28.080
Damn that Marik!

00:20:28.080 --> 00:20:29.520
I promise to beat him!

00:20:29.520 --> 00:20:31.670
Don't be reckless!

00:20:32.040 --> 00:20:38.060
Yugi, shouldn't we land the airship and take Bakura to the hospital?

00:20:38.060 --> 00:20:39.650
Yeah, you're right.

00:20:39.650 --> 00:20:41.490
Let's ask Kaiba.

